msgid "All challenges are issued before the player sees their own hand."
msgstr "所有挑战都在玩家看到自己的手牌之前发出。"

msgid "All four of your sets are sequences. In addition, you may not have any honor tiles. Does not stack with No Honors (1 Fan)."
msgstr "你的四组面子全部是顺子。此外，你不能有任何字牌。不与无字牌（1番）复合。"

msgid "All honour tiles are flowers."
msgstr "所有字牌都视为花牌。"

msgid "All of your sets and your pair contain a five."
msgstr "你所有的面子和你的一对都包含五。"

msgid "All of your sets are triplets (or kongs)."
msgstr "你所有的面子都是刻子（或杠）。"

msgid "All players below %{below} score pays %{chips} chips to others (tobi)"
msgstr "所有分数低于%{below}的玩家向他人支付%{chips}枚筹码（飞び）"

msgid "All players below %{below} score pays 1 chip to others (tobi)"
msgstr "所有分数低于%{below}的玩家向他人支付1枚筹码（飞び）"

msgid "All scores are rounded to 1000s instead of 100s."
msgstr "所有分数四舍五入到千位，而不是百位。"

msgid "Allow any concealed kan while in riichi, even ones that change your waits."
msgstr "允许在立直中进行任何暗杠，即使是改变听牌的暗杠。"

msgid "Allow chii during sanma."
msgstr "允许在三人麻将中吃牌。"

msgid "Allow robbing ankans if in tenpai for kokushi musou."
msgstr "若为国士无双听牌，允许抢暗杠。"

msgid "Allow swapping out fei jokers from your own pungs using the same tile."
msgstr "允许使用相同的牌将飞牌从你自己的碰牌中换出。"

msgid "Although the player to our left discarded a 3 of bamboo, it cannot be called to complete our 234, because in Tianjin Mahjong you can only call triplets (Pung) or quads (Kong), not sequences."
msgstr "虽然左边的玩家打出了3索，但它不能被叫来完成我们的234，因为在天津麻将中，你只能叫刻子（碰）或杠子（杠），不能叫顺子。"

msgid "Always award 1 Fan for having a hand consisting of only one suit plus honors. This is always awarded (unless you have one of the Limit hands)."
msgstr "始终授予1番给仅由一种花色和字牌组成的手牌。这始终授予（除非你拥有其中一种上限手牌）。"

