msgid "At exhaustive draw, you are not considered tenpai if all four tiles of each wait is in hand: for example, 123456789m1111p. You may still declare riichi with such a hand, however."
msgstr "在流局时，如果每种听牌的牌都在手牌中，则不视为听牌：例如，123456789m1111p。但是，你仍然可以用这种手牌宣告立直。"

msgid "At the beginning of each round, each player in turn may decide to challenge the dealer. This doubles the payment from the dealer if the challenger wins, but it also doubles the payment from the challenger if the dealer wins."
msgstr "在每局开始时，每位玩家依次可以决定向庄家发出挑战。如果挑战者赢了，庄家的支付加倍，但如果庄家赢了，挑战者的支付也加倍。"

msgid "At the beginning of the game, %{start_indicators} dora indicators are revealed in the dead wall."
msgstr "在游戏开始时，王牌墙中会揭示%{start_indicators}张宝牌指示牌。"

msgid "At the beginning of the game, 1 dora indicator is revealed in the dead wall."
msgstr "在游戏开始时，王牌墙中会揭示1张宝牌指示牌。"

msgid "At the beginning of the game, two dice are rolled to get a value N, and the Nth tile from the back of the wall is flipped to reveal the Hun'er, i.e. the wildcards."
msgstr "在游戏开始时，掷两个骰子得到值 N，然后翻开牌墙背面第 N 张牌以揭示混儿，即万能牌。"

msgid "At the end of each round, each player counts the number of Fei jokers in each hand, and recieves a side payment of 50 from each player for each Fei joker they have."
msgstr "在每局结束时，每位玩家计算每手牌中的飞牌数量，并根据手中每张飞牌从每位玩家处获得50点的附加支付。"

msgid "At the end of the game, 1st/2nd/3rd/4th receive a bonus of %{1st}/%{2nd}/%{3rd}/%{4th} chips."
msgstr "在游戏结束时，第1/2/3/4名获得 %{1st}/%{2nd}/%{3rd}/%{4th} 枚筹码的奖励。"

msgid "At the end of the game, 1st/2nd/3rd/4th receive a bonus of %{1st}/%{2nd}/%{3rd}/%{4th} points."
msgstr "在游戏结束时，第1/2/3/4名获得 %{1st}/%{2nd}/%{3rd}/%{4th} 点的奖励。"

msgid "At the end of the game, all leftover riichi sticks on the table are given to first place. (Otherwise they are lost.)"
msgstr "在游戏结束时，牌桌上所有剩余的立直棒都给予第一名。（否则它们将被丢弃。）"

msgid "At the end of the game, only the final ranking matters, and the final score is decided by oka and uma."
msgstr "在游戏结束时，只有最终排名重要，最终分数由头衔和马决定。"

msgid "At the start of the game, before declaring your voided suit, you must select three tiles to pass to another player (determined by the dice)."
msgstr "在游戏开始时，在宣告你的缺门花色之前，你必须选择三张牌传给另一位玩家（由骰子决定）。"

msgid "At the start of the game, you must declare a voided suit (one of Bams, Craks, Dots)."
msgstr "在游戏开始时，你必须宣告一个缺门花色（索、万、筒之一）。"

msgid "At the start of the round, each player chooses to pass 3 tiles to the player to the right. This is one charleston pass. A total of 3 charleston passes are done (right, across, left) and if all players agree, 3 more passes are done (left, across, right). Regardless of the decision, there is a final round where each player decides to pass 0 to 3 tiles across, and both player passes the lower amount of the two decisions."
msgstr "在局开始时，每位玩家选择将3张牌传给右边的玩家。这是一次查尔斯顿传牌。总共进行3次查尔斯顿传牌（右、对面、左），如果所有玩家同意，再进行3次传牌（左、对面、右）。无论决定如何，都有一个最终轮，每位玩家决定传0到3张牌给对面，双方传出较少的数量。"

