msgid "Because it won't get us any closer to winning, let's not call chii. Press Cancel."
msgstr "因为它不会让我们更接近和牌，所以我们不要吃。按「取消」。"

msgid "Because the last discard can complete a sequence, we can call Chii to take the last discard, in lieu of drawing a tile. Do so now."
msgstr "因为最后一张弃牌可以完成顺子，我们可以叫吃来拿最后一张弃牌，而不是摸牌。现在就这样做。"

