msgstr "你所有的面子和一对都包含么九牌或字牌。"

msgid "Each payment between the dealer and another player is multiplied by 2 for every dealer challenge issued this round."
msgstr "本局发出的每个庄家挑战，庄家与其他玩家之间的每次支付都乘以2。"

