msgstr "每位玩家以%{starting_shuugi}枚筹码开始。"

msgid "Each player starts with a set amount of points. Players' point totals can't go negative. If a player runs out of points, they need not pay."
msgstr "每位玩家以设定的点数开始。玩家的点数总和不能为负。如果玩家点数用完，他们无需支付。"

msgid "Each quad (Coong) of any type awards you 1 Phán each. If you have four Quads, you are instead awarded Four Quads (4 Mủn!)."
msgstr "任何类型的每组杠可获得1 Phán。如果你有四次杠，则改为授予四杠（4 Mủn！）。"

msgid "Each round always starts with a flower declaration round. Starting from the East seat, each player replaces flowers in hand, or declares \\\"No Flowers\\\"."
msgstr "每局总是以花牌宣告轮开始。从东位开始，每位玩家替换手中的花牌，或宣告「无花牌」。"

msgid "Each tile in the wall is transparent and visible to all (e.g. %{transparent_8m}), except for one copy. Unflipped dora indicators are not visible."
msgstr "牌墙中的每张牌都是透明的，所有人都可见（例如：%{transparent_8m}），除了一张之外。未翻开的宝牌指示牌不可见。"

msgid "Each tile in the wall is transparent and visible to all, except for one copy. Unflipped dora indicators are not visible."
msgstr "牌墙中的每张牌都是透明的，所有人都可见，除了一张之外。未翻开的宝牌指示牌不可见。"

