msgstr "启用吃"

msgid "Enable busting. Once anyone's points is reduced below zero (or the specified value), the game ends."
msgstr "启用飞び。一旦任何人的点数低于零（或指定值），游戏结束。"

msgid "Enable called game. Once anyone's points reaches above 54999 (or the specified value), the game ends."
msgstr "启用提前结束。一旦任何人的点数超过54999（或指定值），游戏结束。"

msgid "Enable head bump. In case of multiple hu, only the person closest in turn order gets the win."
msgstr "启用头跳ね。在多个和牌的情况下，只有轮到顺序最近的人获得和牌。"

msgid "Enable head bump. In case of multiple ron, only the person closest in turn order gets the win."
msgstr "启用头跳ね。在多个荣和的情况下，只有轮到顺序最近的人获得和牌。"

