msgstr "启用一发。「一击」。若在立直后、下一次摸牌前或摸牌时和牌，可获得1番。副露无效。"

msgid "Enables kansai yaku, namely: Three Consecutive Triplets (2 Han), Four Consecutive Triplets (Yakuman), Big Three Winds (2 Han), Manzu Chinitsu (Yakuman), Honitsu Chiitoitsu (6 Han), and Chinitsu Chiitoitsu (Yakuman). The last three don't stack with Honitsu/Chinitsu/Chiitoitsu."
msgstr "启用关西役，即：三连刻（2番）、四连刻（役满）、大三风（2番）、万子清一色（役满）、混一色七对子（6番）和清一色七对子（役满）。最后三个不与混一色/清一色/七对子复合。"

msgid "Enables kin dora (gold fives), worth 3 han each."
msgstr "启用金宝牌（金五），每张价值3番。"

msgid "Enables nippatsu. 1 han if you win during the second go-around after riichi ippatsu. Calls invalidate."
msgstr "启用二发。若在立直一发后的第二轮和牌，可获得1番。副露无效。"

