msgid "Looking at your hand, you already have 234,456,777 of circles and 888 of bamboo."
msgstr "看看你的手牌，你已经有筒子的234、456、777和索子的888。"

msgid "Looks like you drew another 3 of bamboo! Because you have a pair of 3 bamboo in your calls, you may call Pon on your turn in order to upgrade it to a triplet (kapon, added triplet). Try it now!"
msgstr "看起来你又摸到了一张3索！因为你的副露中有一对3索，你可以在你的回合叫碰，将其升级为刻子（加碰，添加刻子）。现在尝试一下！"

msgid "Looks like you drew the last 3 bamboo! Just like with kapon, you can call Kan here to form a glorious added-added kan (kakakan). Go right ahead!"
msgstr "看起来你摸到了最后一张3索！就像加碰一样，你可以在这里叫杠，形成一个辉煌的加加杠。继续吧！"

