msgid "Not only that, the replacement tile was our winning green dragon! Winning after a fuun replacement tile awards rinshan, which is our yaku. Declare tsumo!"
msgstr "不仅如此，替换牌是我们的和牌发！在风圈替换牌后和牌可获得岭上开花，这是我们的役。宣告自摸！"

msgid "Note that Fei jokers cannot be used in Gongs."
msgstr "请注意，飞牌不能用于杠。"

msgid "Note that a double wait, such as %{t2} waiting on %{t3}, does not count. You can only have a single wait."
msgstr "请注意，双面听牌（如%{t2}等待%{t3}）不计入。你只能有单骑听牌。"

msgid "Note that if you are in East seat, East Winds are counted twice."
msgstr "请注意，如果你在东位，东风会被计数两次。"

msgid "Note that issuing a challenge costs one challenge token. You only get two per game."
msgstr "请注意，发出挑战会消耗一个挑战令牌。你每场游戏只有两个。"

msgid "Note that no winning hand can include flower tiles in hand, so you must declare them (or discard them) at some point."
msgstr "请注意，任何和牌手牌都不能在手牌中包含花牌，所以你必须在某个时候宣告它们（或打出它们）。"

msgid "Note that some hands can only be won while concealed (no calls). These are marked with 'c' to the right of the Nearest Hands hands. 'x' on the other hand means 'exposed' and you can win those hands whether your hand has calls or not."
msgstr "请注意，有些手牌只能在门前清（无副露）时和牌。这些在「最近手牌」手牌的右侧用「c」标记。另一方面，「x」表示「明」，无论你的手牌是否有副露，你都可以和这些手牌。"

msgid "Note that the dealer just discarded a 3 of characters, which would have completed our hand!"
msgstr "请注意，庄家刚打出了3万，这本可以完成我们的手牌！"

msgid "Note that unlike Chii, which can only be called from your left, calling Pon messes with the turn order. The left player's turn got skipped, and now it's your turn to discard."
msgstr "请注意，与只能从左边叫的吃不同，碰会打乱回合顺序。左边玩家的回合被跳过了，现在轮到你打出。"

msgid "Note that you are not given a replacement tile for calling an added pon. This makes sense, since you aren't 'extra' one tile after calling, unlike with kan."
msgstr "请注意，你叫加碰时不会获得替换牌。这是有道理的，因为与杠不同，你在叫牌后不会「多出」一张牌。"

msgid "Note that you cannot win on an opponent's discard or Kong."
msgstr "请注意，你不能以对手的弃牌或杠和牌。"

msgid "Note that you were not prompted to call ton on this white dragon. Since there's no way to orient the called tile to indicate \\\"across\\\", you can only call ton from your left or your right, not across."
msgstr "请注意，你没有被提示对这张白叫吨。由于没有办法将被叫的牌定向为「对面」，你只能从左边或右边叫吨，不能从对面。"

msgid "Note that your existing 3 of circles is grayed out -- it cannot be discarded. This is because we are playing with a rule called \\\"kuikae nashi\\\", i.e. no swap-calling. You cannot call with 45 of circles and subsequently discard 3 or 6 of circles."
msgstr "请注意，你现有的3筒是灰色的——它不能被打出。这是因为我们正在玩一个名为「禁止换吃」的规则。你不能用4、5筒吃牌，然后打出3或6筒。"

