msgid "Otherwise, the gold tile is a joker for any tile, but it cannot be used in calls."
msgstr "否则，金牌可以作为任何牌的鬼牌，但不能用于叫牌。"

msgid "Our Kong replacement tile is a 6 of characters. Since we have a wildcard in hand, we can either discard it and wait on 1, 2, 3, 4, or 5 bamboo, or we could discard 2 bamboo to wait on any character tile except 9."
msgstr "我们的杠替换牌是6万。由于我们手中有万能牌，我们可以打出它并等待1、2、3、4或5索，或者我们可以打出2索来等待除9以外的任何万子。"

