msgid "That's about all there is to galaxy mahjong!"
msgstr "银河麻将大概就是这样了！"

msgid "That's pretty much it for the basics, press Back on the upper right to return to the list of tutorials!"
msgstr "基本内容就这些了，按右上角的「返回」返回教程列表！"

msgid "The 100 point sticks in the middle count honba. Each adds %{value} extra points to the winning value. One honba stick is added for every drawn round, and reset to 0 on a win."
msgstr "中间的100点棒计为本场。每个为和牌价值增加%{value}点。每流局一次增加一根本场棒，和牌时重置为0。"

msgid "The 19m tiles can be called as nukidora."
msgstr "19m可以作为拔宝牌宣告。"

msgid "The AI for most variants including Riichi use the standard AI, which simply discards towards the closest win condition."
msgstr "包括立直在内的大多数变体使用的 AI 都是标准 AI，它只是朝着最近的和牌条件打出。"

msgid "The Face, Animal, Flower, and Season tiles %{flowers} are all considered flower tiles. Their scoring is detailed in the Flowers tab. You also receive a bonus if you declare a set of 4 flowers, see the Rules tab for more details."
msgstr "人物牌、动物牌、花牌和季节牌%{flowers}都被视为花牌。它们的计分在「花牌」选项卡中详细说明。如果你宣告一组4张花牌，你也会获得奖励，详见「规则」选项卡。"

msgid "The Fei Joker %{fei} is a wildcard that can stand for any tile. They may also be declared as flowers for 1 Fei each by pressing the Reveal Fei button."
msgstr "飞牌%{fei}是万能牌，可以代表任何牌。也可以按「揭示飞」按钮将它们宣告为花牌，每张1飞。"

msgid "The anything joker %{tong} can be replaced for 3 Phán if you are the East player or if you replace it at the start of the game, or 2 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "万能鬼牌%{tong}，如果你是东家或在游戏开始时替换它，可以替换为3 Phán，否则为2 Phán。"

msgid "The bamboo joker %{sooc} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the West player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "索子鬼牌%{sooc}，如果你是西家，可以替换为2 Phán，否则为1 Phán。"

msgid "The character joker %{man} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the North player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "万子鬼牌%{man}，如果你是北家，可以替换为2 Phán，否则为1 Phán。"

msgid "The classic riichi ruleset, now with an assortment of mods to pick and choose at your liking."
msgstr "经典的立直规则集，现在有各种模组供你随意挑选。"

msgid "The dealer (who goes first) may also double down, essentially challenging all three players at once. This does not consume challenge tokens."
msgstr "庄家（先手）也可以双倍下注，本质上同时挑战所有三位玩家。这不会消耗挑战令牌。"

msgid "The dealer gets 2 points for each dealer continuation."
msgstr "庄家每次连庄获得2点。"

msgid "The dealer pays everyone a discard chase bonus of $amt"
msgstr "庄家向所有人支付$amt的追打奖励"

msgid "The dealer won on their first draw."
msgstr "庄家在第一次摸牌时和牌。"

msgid "The distinguishing factor of space mahjong is that sequences can wrap. In other words, 891 and 912 are valid sequences."
msgstr "太空麻将的显著特点是顺子可以循环。换句话说，891和912是有效的顺子。"

msgid "The dora indicator is a galaxy white dragon. Since galaxy dragons are dragon wildcards, they indicate all other dragons as dora, including your two actual white dragons."
msgstr "宝牌指示牌是银河白。由于银河三元牌是三元牌万能牌，它们指示所有其他三元牌为宝牌，包括你的两张实际的白。"

msgid "The dot joker %{thung} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the South player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "筒子鬼牌%{thung}，如果你是南家，可以替换为2 Phán，否则为1 Phán。"

msgid "The dragon joker %{nguyen} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the West player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "三元鬼牌%{nguyen}，如果你是西家，可以替换为2 Phán，否则为1 Phán。"

msgid "The flower joker %{hoa} can be replaced for 2 Phán regardless of seat."
msgstr "花鬼牌%{hoa}，无论风位如何，都可以替换为2 Phán。"

msgid "The game consists of two east rounds."
msgstr "游戏由两个东圈组成。"

msgid "The game ends once the next draw is the last dora indicator."
msgstr "一旦下一次摸牌是最后一张宝牌指示牌，游戏结束。"

msgid "The gold tile is determined by checking each tile in the dead wall until you find a non-flower tile. Flowers revealed in this process are given to the player whose wall is broken. If all nine tiles on the dead wall are flowers, then there is no gold tile for the round."
msgstr "金牌是通过检查王牌墙中的每张牌，直到找到一张非花牌来确定的。在此过程中揭示的花牌归于被切牌的玩家。如果王牌墙上的九张牌都是花牌，那么本局没有金牌。"

msgid "The maximum hand value is 320 points. However, if your winning hand matches a pattern worth more than 320 points, score only that pattern and its points."
msgstr "手牌的最大值为320点。但是，如果你的和牌匹配一个价值超过320点的牌型，只计该牌型及其点数。"

msgid "The number joker %{hop} can be replaced for 3 Phán if you are the North player or if you replace it at the start of the game, or 2 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "数字鬼牌%{hop}，如果你是北家或在游戏开始时替换它，可以替换为3 Phán，否则为2 Phán。"

msgid "The object of the game is to obtain four sets and a pair. A set is a sequence of three, like 123, or a triplet, like 555."
msgstr "游戏的目标是获得四组面子和一对。面子是像123这样的三张顺子，或像555这样的刻子。"

msgid "The oldest written ruleset for Riichi, featuring 300 point riichi bets and no fu rounding."
msgstr "立直最古老的书面规则集，具有300点立直下注和无符四舍五入。"

msgid "The player across from you has just discarded the east wind, which you have two of."
msgstr "你对面的玩家刚打出了东风，你有两张。"

msgid "The player to our left has discarded a 6 of bamboo, which we'll need for Mixed Shifted, so go ahead and call it! In MCR, there is very little downside to calling tiles."
msgstr "我们左边的玩家打出了6索，这对三色顺子很有用，所以继续叫吧！在 MCR 中，叫牌的缺点很小。"

msgid "The player to your right just played the 2 of circles. In space mahjong, you can chii from any direction, not just from your left. Try it now!"
msgstr "你右边的玩家刚打出了2筒。在太空麻将中，你可以从任何方向吃牌，而不仅仅是从左边。现在尝试一下！"

msgid "The previous player just tossed the 3 of circles, and it's about to be your turn."
msgstr "前一位玩家刚打出了3筒，马上轮到你了。"

msgid "The replacement tile gives us three sets and a pair, so we're tenpai. Now declare riichi on the 9 of bamboo!"
msgstr "替换牌给了我们三组面子和一对，所以我们听牌了。现在在9索上宣告立直！"

msgid "The seven Hun'er are the three copies of the revealed tile, as well as the four copies of the next tile in sequence."
msgstr "七张混儿是揭示牌的三张，以及序列中下一张牌的四张。"

msgid "The tile next in sequence to a dora indicator is considered dora, and each copy of dora in hand is worth 1 extra han. A nine indicator %{nine} indicates the one %{one} as dora. For winds, the sequence is %{east} > %{south} > %{west} > %{north} > %{east}. For dragons, the sequence is %{white}, %{green}, %{red} > %{white}."
msgstr "宝牌指示牌序列中的下一张牌被视为宝牌，手牌中的每张宝牌价值增加1番。九的指示牌%{nine}指示一%{one}为宝牌。对于风牌，顺序为%{east} > %{south} > %{west} > %{north} > %{east}。对于三元牌，顺序为%{white}、%{green}、%{red} > %{white}。"

msgid "The tsumo and ron buttons are enabled on every draw and discard. If you make an incorrect win call, your hand is dead and you cannot make a win call for the remainder of the round."
msgstr "自摸和荣按钮在每次摸牌和弃牌时都启用。如果你做出错误的和牌宣告，你的手牌将成为死手，并且在本局剩余时间内不能进行和牌宣告。"

msgid "The ura indicator is a galaxy eight circles, which similarly indicates all nines as dora, including your nine of bamboo."
msgstr "里宝牌指示牌是银河8筒，同样指示所有9为宝牌，包括你的9索。"

msgid "The very first thing you do (before seeing your hand!) is to up the ante by issuing challenges against the dealer (East player). The dealer may do the same."
msgstr "你要做的第一件事（在看你手牌之前！）是通过向庄家（东家）发出挑战来提高赌注。庄家也可以这样做。"

msgid "The wall also contains four each of the 1 to 9 of Stars %{stars}"
msgstr "牌墙还包含每种星1至9各4张 %{stars}"

msgid "The wall consists of:"
msgstr "牌墙由以下组成："

msgid "The wall is composed of 16 copies of each bamboo tile."
msgstr "牌墙由每种索子16张组成。"

msgid "The wildcard could be used to make another set, either filling the 24 of bamboo, or making a triplet out of one of the pairs."
msgstr "万能牌可以用来组成另一组面子，要么填充24索，要么从一对中形成刻子。"

msgid "The wind joker %{hi} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the South player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "风鬼牌%{hi}，如果你是南家，可以替换为2 Phán，否则为1 Phán。"

msgid "There are 8 jokers in the game: %{jokers}."
msgstr "游戏中有8张鬼牌：%{jokers}。"

msgid "There are by default 8 jokers %{joker} in the wall. Any amount of jokers can be used to call tiles. By default, calls that don't use any non-joker tiles are automatically skipped, but you can deactivate this behavior by toggling off the JC button on the bottom-left (you only need to do this once)."
msgstr "默认情况下，牌墙中有8张鬼牌%{joker}。可以使用任意数量的鬼牌来叫牌。默认情况下，不使用任何非鬼牌的叫牌会自动跳过，但你可以通过关闭左下角的 JC 按钮来停用此行为（你只需要执行一次）。"

msgid "There are four copies of the 10 of each suit: %{tens}"
msgstr "每种花色有4张10：%{tens}"

msgid "There are no abortive draws enabled."
msgstr "没有启用的中途流局。"

msgid "There is a fourth suit, stars: %{stars}"
msgstr "有第四种花色，星：%{stars}"

msgid "These are the tiles that are purely green in color."
msgstr "这些是纯绿色的牌。"

