msgid "This draw (4 of circles) is ideal, not only because it lets us win on the 1 of characters (for Mixed Shifted 234 345 456)..."
msgstr "这次摸牌（4筒）是理想的，不仅因为它让我们能在1万上和牌（为了三色顺子234 345 456）..."

msgid "This example hand is only awarded Four Concealed Pungs if the %{t} was self-drawn. Otherwise, it would award Three Concealed Pungs (16 Fan)."
msgstr "这个示例手牌只有在%{t}是自摸时才授予四暗刻。否则，它会授予三暗刻（16番）。"

msgid "This hand might score two instances of Two Terminal Chows (1+1 Fan) and two instances of Mixed Double Chow (1+1 Fan), but this creates a 'loop' connection with the four sets, and this is disallowed. You can only pick three of the four Fan to score, avoiding the loop."
msgstr "这手牌可能计两次二杯口（1+1番）和两次混合二杯口（1+1番），但这会与四组面子形成「循环」连接，这是不允许的。你只能从四个番中选择三个来计分，避免循环。"

msgid "This is a tutorial, so of course you get the tile you want immediately. Press Ron."
msgstr "这是教程，所以你当然会立即得到你想要的牌。按「荣」。"

msgid "This is another example, you can only score two of the Fan among Mixed Straight (8 Fan), Two Terminal Chows (1 Fan), and Mixed Double Chow (1 Fan)."
msgstr "这是另一个例子，你只能在三色顺子（8番）、二杯口（1番）和混合二杯口（1番）中计两个番。"

msgid "This is because calling Kong in Tianjin gives an immediate payout of 1 point."
msgstr "这是因为在天津叫杠会立即获得1点的支付。"

msgid "This is because galaxy tiles are suitless! A galaxy 2 can be used as any 2 tile, including 2 of bamboo. So we could chii 234, if we wished."
msgstr "这是因为银河牌是无花色的！银河2可以用作任何2，包括2索。所以如果我们愿意，我们可以吃234。"

msgid "This is your hand. Whenever it's your turn, you will automatically draw a tile and discard a tile."
msgstr "这是你的手牌。每当轮到你时，你会自动摸一张牌并打出一张牌。"

msgid "This kind of makes sense because it is very easy to make sequences by using wildcards, so calling for sequences would make games go too quickly."
msgstr "这在某种程度上是有道理的，因为使用万能牌很容易组成顺子，所以叫顺子会让游戏进行得太快。"

msgid "This means that your 91 in circles is actually a double-sided wait for 8 and 2. Pretty silly, right? Let's try going for sanshoku on 912."
msgstr "这意味着你筒子中的91实际上是8和2的双面听牌。很傻吧？让我们尝试在912上做三色。"

msgid "This rule only takes effect for Fan that care about arrangements of sets, so other Fan like Tile Hog (2 Fan) and All Simples (2 Fan) are unaffected."
msgstr "此规则仅对涉及面子排列的番生效，因此其他番如牌霸（2番）和断么九（2番）不受影响。"

