msgid "We are now in \\\"tenpai\\\": our hand is waiting for the 2 or 5 of characters in order to complete our remaining set and win. We could either self draw the tile..."
msgstr "我们现在处于「听牌」状态：我们的手牌正在等待2万或5万来完成我们剩余的面子并和牌。我们可以自己摸到这张牌..."

msgid "We are very close to winning: we just need one more tile. Go ahead and discard a 4 of characters."
msgstr "我们非常接近和牌：我们只需要一张牌。继续打出一张4万。"

msgid "We drew a galaxy north wind! But what's the riichi button doing there?"
msgstr "我们摸到了一张银河北风！但是立直按钮在那里做什么？"

msgid "We scored one pattern, Capturing the Five, which essentially means completing a 456 of characters by drawing the 5 of characters (which could also be a wildcard)."
msgstr "我们计了一个牌型，捉五，这本质上意味着通过摸到5万（也可以是万能牌）来完成456万。"

msgid "We'd also like to get All Sequences (2 Fan if all sequences, and no honor tiles), which would bring the total to the required 8 Fan. For this, we'll discard the wind tile."
msgstr "我们还想获得全顺子（如果全是顺子且无字牌，则为2番），这将使总数达到所需的8番。为此，我们将打出风牌。"

msgid "We're now tenpai, waiting on white dragon, but unfortunately we have no yaku. What to do?"
msgstr "我们现在听牌了，等待白，但不幸的是我们没有役。怎么办？"

msgid "Welcome to MCR (Mahjong Competition Rules)! The main challenge of this variant is finding a way to score 8 Fan before everyone else."
msgstr "欢迎来到 MCR（竞技麻将规则）！这种变体的主要挑战是在其他人之前找到获得8番的方法。"

msgid "Welcome to Riichi Advanced!"
msgstr "欢迎来到立直高级版！"

msgid "Welcome to Tianjin Mahjong! This variant features wildcard tiles called Hun'er, of which there are 7 per game: 3 copies of what would be the dora indicator in Riichi (shown on upper left), and 4 copies of the 'dora' it indicates. All 7 tiles are considered Hun'er, and can be used as any tile."
msgstr "欢迎来到天津麻将！这种变体具有名为混儿的万能牌，每场游戏有7张：立直中宝牌指示牌的三张（显示在左上角），以及它指示的「宝牌」的四张。所有7张牌都被视为混儿，可以用作任何牌。"

msgid "Welcome to cosmic riichi! This is a space mahjong variant that adds several new calls and ways to earn +0.5 han and +1 fu. Let's get started."
msgstr "欢迎来到宇宙立直！这是太空麻将的一种变体，添加了几种新的叫牌和获得+0.5番和+1符的方式。让我们开始吧。"

msgid "Welcome to galaxy mahjong, a riichi variant that replaces 1 of each kind of tile with a light blue 'galaxy' tile. What do these mysterious tiles do? Let's find out!"
msgstr "欢迎来到银河麻将，一种立直变体，将每种牌各一张替换为浅蓝色「银河」牌。这些神秘的牌是做什么的？让我们找出答案！"

msgid "Welcome to sanma! This is the standard three-player variant of riichi, where the name of the game is forming big hands."
msgstr "欢迎来到三麻！这是标准的三人立直变体，游戏的关键在于形成大牌。"

msgid "Welcome to space mahjong! Let's get started by discarding this white dragon -- you'll soon see why."
msgstr "欢迎来到太空麻将！让我们从打出这张白开始——你很快就会明白为什么。"

msgid "When any player discards a tile you can use to complete a triplet, you may call Pong to take that tile. Then it becomes your turn to discard."
msgstr "当任何玩家打出一张你可以用来完成刻子的牌时，你可以叫碰来拿那张牌。然后轮到你打出。"

msgid "When it comes to forming a winning hand, jokers cannot be used to fill single tiles or pairs. A hand like '1 22 333' can use up to three jokers for the 333, but no jokers can be used for the 1 or 22. There are no sequences in American Mahjong, only singles, pairs, triplets, quads, and so on."
msgstr "在形成和牌手牌时，鬼牌不能用于填充单张或对子。像「1 22 333」这样的手牌最多可以使用三张鬼牌来填充333，但1或22不能使用鬼牌。美国麻将中没有顺子，只有单张、对子、刻子、杠子等。"

msgid "When someone discards the final tile you need in order to win, you can declare a win by calling Ron. Do so now."
msgstr "当有人打出你需要的和牌所需的最后一张牌时，你可以叫荣来宣告和牌。现在就这样做。"

msgid "When the gold tile is revealed, if it is your winning tile, you may instantly declare a win off it (Qiangjin)."
msgstr "当金牌被揭示时，如果它是你的和牌，你可以立即宣告和牌（强金）。"

msgid "When the player to your left discards a tile you can use to complete a 3 tile sequence, you may call Chow to take that tile instead of drawing."
msgstr "当你左边的玩家打出一张你可以用来完成三张顺子的牌时，你可以叫吃来拿那张牌，而不是摸牌。"

msgid "When viewing the rules, you can hover/tap any tile to enlarge it."
msgstr "查看规则时，你可以将鼠标悬停/点击任何牌以放大它。"

