msgstr "七张牌内"

msgid "Within Ten Discards"
msgstr "十张弃牌内"

msgid "Within Ten Tiles"
msgstr "十张牌内"

msgid "Without honor tiles, you would instead be awarded Full Flush (24 Han)."
msgstr "如果没有字牌，你将改为获得清一色（24番）。"

msgid "Wu"
msgstr "吴"

msgid "Yae Kobashiri"
msgstr "小林やえ"

msgid "Yakitori"
msgstr "烧鸟"

msgid "Yakitori (AI)"
msgstr "烧鸟（AI）"

msgid "Yaku"
msgstr "役"

msgid "Yakuhai"
msgstr "役牌"

msgid "Yakuless (AI)"
msgstr "无役（AI）"

msgid "Yakuman"
msgstr "役满"

msgid "Yakuman base"
msgstr "役满基本点"

msgid "Yakuman dealer tsumo"
msgstr "役满庄家自摸"

msgid "Yakuman if your hand contains four copies of the exact same kontsu."
msgstr "如果你的手牌包含四组完全相同的混合刻子，则为役满。"

msgid "Yakuman is typically worth 10 shuugi on ron and 5 on tsumo."
msgstr "役满通常荣和价值10点祝仪，自摸价值5点。"

msgid "Yakuman ron"
msgstr "役满荣和"

msgid "Yakuman tsumo"
msgstr "役满自摸"

msgid "Yamagoshi (AI)"
msgstr "山越し（AI）"

msgid "Yami"
msgstr "暗"

msgid "Yasume (AI)"
msgstr "安目（AI）"

msgid "Yeah, that's what I thought."
msgstr "是的，我就是这么想的。"

msgid "Yes Riichi Ankan"
msgstr "允许立直暗杠"

msgid "Yondoukon"
msgstr "四同刻"

msgid "Yonshoku"
msgstr "四色"

msgid "Yonshoku Doukou"
msgstr "四色同刻"

msgid "Yoshitome Miharu"
msgstr "吉留美春"

msgid "You are only waiting for one kind of tile, and the wait is a 'middle' wait (like 35 waiting for 4)."
msgstr "你只等待一种牌，且听牌是「中间」听牌（如35等待4）。"

msgid "You are only waiting for one kind of tile, and the wait is a pair wait, like %{t1} waiting for another %{t1}."
msgstr "你只等待一种牌，且听牌是对子听牌，如%{t1}等待另一张%{t1}。"

msgid "You are only waiting for one kind of tile, and the wait is either 12 waiting for 3, or 89 waiting for 7."
msgstr "你只等待一种牌，且听牌是12等待3或89等待7。"

msgid "You are paid 1 points by each other player for declaring an added kong with the tile you just drew."
msgstr "你用刚摸到的牌宣告加杠，每位其他玩家向你支付1点。"

msgid "You are paid 2 points by each other player for declaring a concealed kong."
msgstr "你宣告暗杠，每位其他玩家向你支付2点。"

msgid "You are paid 2 points by the discarder for declaring an open kong."
msgstr "你宣告明杠，打出牌者向你支付2点。"

msgid "You can Kong this tile! As usual, calling kong gives you a replacement tile draw, and then it becomes your turn to discard. In Tianjin it is almost always beneficial to call Kong."
msgstr "你可以用这张牌开杠！像往常一样，叫杠会给你一张替换牌，然后轮到你打出。在天津，叫杠几乎总是有利的。"

msgid "You can also replace jokers in hand with a replacement tile during your turn. Each joker declared this way earns 1 Faan."
msgstr "你也可以在你的回合用替换牌替换手中的鬼牌。每张以此方式宣告的鬼牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You can declare NEWS (one of each wind) as a concealed kan, worth 16 fu, and you draw a replacement tile from the live wall."
msgstr "你可以将 NEWS（每种风牌各一张）宣告为暗杠，价值16符，并从活牌墙抽一张替换牌。"

msgid "You can discard Anything (縂) and Number (合) jokers at any time during your turn. However, other jokers cannot be discarded after the initial flower phase, unless you are going for a No Flowers No Leaves hand."
msgstr "你可以在你的回合中随时打出万能（縂）和数字（合）鬼牌。但是，其他鬼牌在初始花牌阶段后不能被打出，除非你要做无花无叶手。"

msgid "You can double click or right click to discard your drawn tile or skip a call. (On mobile: double tap or long tap.)"
msgstr "你可以双击或右键单击来打出你摸到的牌或跳过叫牌。（在移动设备上：双击或长按。）"

msgid "You can have two instances of this, for example:"
msgstr "你可以有两个实例，例如："

msgid "You can no longer call north winds as nukidora."
msgstr "你不能再将北风作为拔宝牌宣告。"

msgid "You can replace jokers in hand %{jokers} with a replacement tile during your turn. Each joker declared this way earns 1 Faan. Jokers declared in this manner cannot be robbed for a win."
msgstr "你可以把你的回合中用替换牌替换手中的鬼牌%{jokers}。每张以此方式宣告的鬼牌可获得1番。以此方式宣告的鬼牌不能被抢和。"

msgid "You can use up to two Fei Jokers in a called Pong, and one Fei joker in a called Chow. Fei jokers cannot be used in a Gong."
msgstr "你最多可以在叫碰中使用两张飞牌，在叫吃中使用一张飞牌。飞牌不能用于杠。"

msgid "You can win on this 3 bamboo, because you have three sets of 912 after making a pair of 3 bamboo. That's sanshoku!"
msgstr "你可以以这张3索和牌，因为你在做了一对3索之后有了三组912。那是三色！"

msgid "You cannot add a joker to a pung, nor can you concealed kong with a joker."
msgstr "你不能将鬼牌加到碰牌上，也不能用鬼牌暗杠。"

msgid "You cannot pung a discard using more than one joker."
msgstr "你不能使用超过一张鬼牌来碰弃牌。"

msgid "You cannot sheung a discarded joker."
msgstr "你不能吃被丢弃的鬼牌。"

msgid "You cannot win on a discarded joker."
msgstr "你不能以被丢弃的鬼牌和牌。"

msgid "You cannot win on a discarded tile that you yourself have discarded (or skipped a win on). You can still win on such tiles by tsumo (self-draw)."
msgstr "你不能以自己打出的牌（或跳过和牌的牌）和牌。你仍然可以以自摸（自摸和牌）在这些牌上和牌。"

msgid "You declared a win off the gold tile when it was revealed."
msgstr "当金牌被揭示时，你宣告以它和牌。"

msgid "You declared four Fei Jokers as flowers. This is also a win condition."
msgstr "你宣告了四张飞牌作为花牌。这也是一个和牌条件。"

msgid "You drew a flower! When you draw a flower in the middle of a game, you can either declare them (like at the start of the round) or discard them (to avoid dealing a dangerous tile)."
msgstr "你摸到了一张花牌！当你在游戏中摸到花牌时，你可以宣告它（就像在局开始时一样）或打出它（以避免打出危险的牌）。"

msgid "You drew a north wind! In sanma, north winds are akin to flower tiles in other variants -- you may declare them and draw a replacement tile. Each north wind (\\\"pei\\\") is worth one extra han, and is otherwise not counted as part of your hand."
msgstr "你摸到了一张北风！在三麻中，北风类似于其他变体中的花牌——你可以宣告它们并抽一张替换牌。每张北风（「北」）价值增加一番，否则不计为你手牌的一部分。"

msgid "You drew the winning tile yourself."
msgstr "你自己摸到了和牌。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan by winning by drawing the last tile in the wall."
msgstr "以自摸牌墙最后一张牌和牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for Robbing a Kong."
msgstr "抢杠可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for each of the following triplets in your hand:"
msgstr "手牌中每有一组下列刻子，可获得1番："

msgid "You get 1 Fan for having the flower tile whose number matches your seat %{tile}, and 1 bonus Fan for having all four %{tiles}."
msgstr "拥有与自家风对应的花牌%{tile}可获得1番，拥有全部四张%{tiles}可获得1奖励番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for having the number 4 flower tile %{four}, and 1 Fan for having the the number 1 flower tile %{tile}. If you are East, this stacks with the seat flower's 1 Fan. Getting all four flowers %{tiles} instead awards 4 fan total."
msgstr "拥有4号花牌%{four}可获得1番，拥有1号花牌%{tile}可获得1番。如果你是东家，这与自风花牌的1番复合。获得全部四张花牌%{tiles}则改为授予总计4番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for having the number 4 season tile %{four}, and 1 Fan for having the number 1 season tile %{tile}. If you are East, this stacks with the seat season's 1 Fan. Getting all four seasons %{tiles} instead awards 4 fan total."
msgstr "拥有4号季节牌%{four}可获得1番，拥有1号季节牌%{tile}可获得1番。如果你是东家，这与自风季节牌的1番复合。获得全部四张季节牌%{tiles}则改为授予总计4番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for having the season tile whose number matches your seat %{tile}, and 1 bonus Fan for having all four %{tiles}."
msgstr "拥有与自家风对应的季节牌%{tile}可获得1番，拥有全部四张%{tiles}可获得1奖励番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for robbing a Gong. That is, an opponent tried to add your winning tile to an existing Pong to make a Gong, but you interrupted them by calling that tile to win."
msgstr "抢杠可获得1番。也就是说，对手试图将你的和牌加到已有的碰牌上组成杠，但你通过叫那张牌和牌打断了他们。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for winning off the replacement draw after you declare a Gong."
msgstr "你宣告杠后以替换牌和牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for winning off the replacement draw after you declare a flower."
msgstr "你宣告花牌后以替换牌和牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan for winning off the replacement draw from declaring a Kong."
msgstr "你宣告杠后以替换牌和牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan if you win by having seven different pairs."
msgstr "以七组不同的对子和牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan if you win off another player's discard immediately after they declare a Kong."
msgstr "他家刚宣告杠后以他的弃牌和牌可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan if your hand comprises four triplets and a pair."
msgstr "手牌由四组刻子和一对组成可获得1番。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan if your hand comprises seven pairs. Pairs may be repeated."
msgstr "手牌由七对组成可获得1番。允许重复对子。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan per Fei Joker you've declared as a flower %{tile}. If you declare all four %{tiles}, you instantly win with 10 Fan (!)"
msgstr "每张宣告为花牌的飞牌可获得1番 %{tile}。如果你宣告全部四张%{tiles}，你立即以10番和牌（！）"

msgid "You get 1 Fan per animal tile %{tile}, plus 1 bonus Fan (5 total) for having all four %{tiles}. Unlike flower and season tiles, all four animal tiles are treated the same."
msgstr "每张动物牌%{tile}可获得1番，拥有全部四张%{tiles}可获得1奖励番（总计5）。与花牌和季节牌不同，四张动物牌被同等对待。"

msgid "You get 1 Fan per face tile %{tile}, and 1 bonus Fan for having all four %{tiles}."
msgstr "每张人物牌%{tile}可获得1番，拥有全部四张%{tiles}可获得1奖励番。"

msgid "You get 1 fan per flower tile called, but this does not contribute to the minimum requirement of 8 fan. The eight flower tiles look like this:"
msgstr "每张被叫的花牌可获得1番，但这不计入最低8番的要求。八张花牌如下："

msgid "You get 1 more Fan if you have four sequences and a pair of dots. In practice, this is always a Full Flush hand with no triplets/Gongs."
msgstr "如果你有四组顺子和一对筒子，可获得另外1番。在实践中，这总是一手没有刻子/杠的清一色手牌。"

msgid "You get 10 Fan (!) if you have all sixteen flowers (all four flowers, all four seasons, all four animals, and all four faces)."
msgstr "如果你拥有全部十六张花牌（全部四张花牌、全部四张季节牌、全部四张动物牌和全部四张人物牌），可获得10番（！）。"

msgid "You get 10 Fan (!) if you have no flowers at all. Declared Fei do not count."
msgstr "如果你完全没有花牌，可获得10番（！）。宣告的飞不计入。"

msgid "You get 10 points for winning."
msgstr "和牌可获得10点。"

msgid "You get 2 Fan if you have called four times, and are waiting on a single tile."
msgstr "如果你有四次副露，并等待单张牌，可获得2番。"

msgid "You get 2 Fan if your hand comprises only tiles of one suit."
msgstr "手牌仅由一种花色的牌组成可获得2番。"

msgid "You get 2 Fan if your hand has four triplets and a pair."
msgstr "手牌有四组刻子和一对可获得2番。"

msgid "You get 2 points per flower tile."
msgstr "每张花牌可获得2点。"

msgid "You get 2 points per gold tile."
msgstr "每张金牌可获得2点。"

msgid "You get 2 points per open kong."
msgstr "每个明杠可获得2点。"

msgid "You get 3 Fan for having two triplets of dragons and a pair of the third."
msgstr "拥有两种三元牌的刻子和第三种的对子可获得3番。"

msgid "You get 3 Fan if your hand has only tiles of one suit (i.e. you have no honour tiles.)"
msgstr "手牌仅由一种花色的牌组成（即你没有字牌）可获得3番。"

msgid "You get one Fan for using all four copies of any given tile. Repeatable."
msgstr "使用任何指定牌的全部四张可获得一番。可重复。"

msgid "You hand contains four Gongs."
msgstr "你的手牌包含四次杠。"

msgid "You have 11 22 33 44 55 66 77 in one suit. It does not have to start at 1. This must be considered a seven-pairs hand, therefore you cannot have any calls."
msgstr "你在单一花色中有11 22 33 44 55 66 77。它不必以1开头。这必须被视为七对子手牌，因此你不能有任何副露。"

msgid "You have 123 456 789 in the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有123 456 789。"

msgid "You have 123 456 789, all of different suits."
msgstr "你的123 456 789全部在不同花色。"

msgid "You have 123 and 789 of the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有123和789。"

msgid "You have Two Terminal Chows (123 789) twice in different suits, plus a pair of fives in the third suit."
msgstr "你在不同花色中有两次二杯口（123 789），外加第三种花色中的一对五。"

msgid "You have a triplet of dragons. Having two dragon triplets instead awards Two Dragon Pungs (6 Fan)."
msgstr "你有一组三元牌刻子。拥有两组三元牌刻子则改为授予二色同刻（6番）。"

msgid "You have a triplet of terminals or honors. This triplet can be either called or concealed, which does not change the value. Note that this only applies to terminals and 'guest' winds: a pung of dragons, round winds, or seat winds instead awards (2 Fan) Dragon Pung, Prevalent Wind, or Seat Wind, respectively. Repeatable."
msgstr "你有一组么九牌或字牌刻子。这组刻子可以是叫来的或暗的，这不会改变价值。请注意，这仅适用于么九牌和「客风」：三元牌、圈风或自风的刻子则分别授予（2番）三元牌、圈风或自风。可重复。"

msgid "You have a triplet of the prevalent (round) wind, currently %{round_wind} (east). Can stack with Seat Wind."
msgstr "你有一组圈风刻子，目前为%{round_wind}（东）。可与自风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of the prevalent (round) wind, currently %{round_wind} (north). Can stack with Seat Wind."
msgstr "你有一组圈风刻子，目前为%{round_wind}（北）。可与自风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of the prevalent (round) wind, currently %{round_wind} (south). Can stack with Seat Wind."
msgstr "你有一组圈风刻子，目前为%{round_wind}（南）。可与自风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of the prevalent (round) wind, currently %{round_wind} (west). Can stack with Seat Wind."
msgstr "你有一组圈风刻子，目前为%{round_wind}（西）。可与自风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of your seat wind, currently %{seat_wind} (east). Can stack with Prevalent Wind."
msgstr "你有一组自风刻子，目前为%{seat_wind}（东）。可与圈风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of your seat wind, currently %{seat_wind} (north). Can stack with Prevalent Wind."
msgstr "你有一组自风刻子，目前为%{seat_wind}（北）。可与圈风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of your seat wind, currently %{seat_wind} (south). Can stack with Prevalent Wind."
msgstr "你有一组自风刻子，目前为%{seat_wind}（南）。可与圈风复合。"

msgid "You have a triplet of your seat wind, currently %{seat_wind} (west). Can stack with Prevalent Wind."
msgstr "你有一组自风刻子，目前为%{seat_wind}（西）。可与圈风复合。"

msgid "You have called a kong. There are two types of Melded Kong: either you used three tiles from hand to claim a discarded 4th, or you added a drawn tile to an existing called triplet to make a kong."
msgstr "你宣告了杠。明杠有两种类型：要么你用手中的三张牌取走被丢弃的第四张，要么你将摸到的牌加到已有的叫来的刻子上组成杠。"

msgid "You have consecutive triplets in the pattern 111 222 333 in different suits."
msgstr "你在不同花色中拥有111 222 333模式的连续刻子。"

msgid "You have consecutive triplets in the pattern 111222333, of the same suit. Note that this cannot stack with Pure Triple Chow (also 24 Fan) since that would arrange your sets differently."
msgstr "你在同一花色中拥有111222333模式的连续刻子。请注意，这不能与一色三节高（也是24番）复合，因为那会以不同的方式排列你的面子。"

msgid "You have consecutive triplets in the pattern 111222333444, of the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中拥有111222333444模式的连续刻子。"

msgid "You have exactly 123 123 55 789 789 in the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中恰好拥有123 123 55 789 789。"

msgid "You have exactly one concealed kong."
msgstr "你恰好有一组暗杠。"

msgid "You have five sequences and a pair."
msgstr "你有五组顺子和一对。"

msgid "You have four concealed triplets. Triplets obtained via win by self-draw count as concealed, but triplets obtained via win by discard/robbing a kong are not concealed."
msgstr "你有四组暗刻。通过自摸和牌获得的刻子计为暗刻，但通过荣和/抢杠和牌获得的刻子不是暗刻。"

msgid "You have four kongs."
msgstr "你有四次杠。"

msgid "You have four of the same sequence in the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有四次相同的顺子。"

msgid "You have four wind triplets."
msgstr "你有四种风牌的刻子。"

msgid "You have never called a tile (except concealed kongs and flowers), and you won off a self-draw. You can consider this an upgraded combination of Concealed Hand (2 Fan) and Self-Drawn (1 Fan)."
msgstr "你从未叫过牌（除暗杠和花牌外），并且以自摸和牌。你可以将此视为门前清（2番）和自摸和牌（1番）的升级组合。"

msgid "You have never called a tile (except flowers and concealed kongs) and you won with someone's discard. Winning with a self-drawn tile instead awards Fully Concealed Hand (4 Fan)."
msgstr "你从未叫过牌（除花牌和暗杠外），并以他家弃牌和牌。以自摸和牌则改为授予全关门手（4番）。"

msgid "You have no calls (except %{ankan}) and you won by self-draw."
msgstr "你没有副露（%{ankan}除外）并以自摸和牌。"

msgid "You have no calls and your winning hand is the pattern 1112345678999 in one suit, plus one additional tile."
msgstr "你没有副露，且和牌是同一花色中的1112345678999，加上一张额外的牌。"

msgid "You have no calls; your winning hand is the pattern 1112345678999 in one suit, plus one additional tile; and you won by self-draw."
msgstr "你没有副露；你的和牌是同一花色中的1112345678999，加上一张额外的牌；并且你以自摸和牌。"

msgid "You have no flowers."
msgstr "你没有花牌。"

msgid "You have no flowers. Declared Fei do not count. (Since the wall is 24% flowers, this is extremely rare.)"
msgstr "你没有花牌。宣告的飞不计入。（由于牌墙中有24%是花牌，这非常罕见。）"

msgid "You have no honor tiles. Stacks with One Voided Suit (1 Fan). If you also have four sequences, you are instead awarded All Chows (2 Fan)."
msgstr "你没有字牌。与缺一门（1番）复合。如果你还有四组顺子，则改为授予全顺子（2番）。"

msgid "You have one of each wind and dragon, plus 7 unique tiles from the following set: 147 of one suit, 258 of a second suit, and 369 of a third suit."
msgstr "你拥有每种风牌和三元牌各一张，加上以下集合中的7张独特牌：一种花色的147、第二种花色的258和第三种花色的369。"

msgid "You have sixteen flowers (all four flowers, all four seasons, all four animals, and all four faces)."
msgstr "你拥有十六张花牌（全部四张花牌、全部四张季节牌、全部四张动物牌和全部四张人物牌）。"

msgid "You have something like 123 234 345 456 in the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有123 234 345 456。"

msgid "You have something like 123 234 345 in the same suit, or 123 345 567 in the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有123 234 345，或同一花色中的123 345 567。"

msgid "You have something like 123 234 345, with each sequence being in a different suit."
msgstr "你的123 234 345每组顺子在不同花色。"

msgid "You have the option to declare open riichi, which is worth 2 han but reveals your hand to the table. Open double riichi is 3 han."
msgstr "你可以选择宣告开立直，价值2番，但会向牌桌揭示你的手牌。开双立直为3番。"

msgid "You have three concealed triplets. Triplets obtained via win by self-draw count as concealed, but triplets obtained via win by discard/robbing a kong are not concealed."
msgstr "你有三组暗刻。通过自摸和牌获得的刻子计为暗刻，但通过荣和/抢杠和牌获得的刻子不是暗刻。"

msgid "You have three dragon triplets."
msgstr "你有三种三元牌的刻子。"

msgid "You have three kongs of any type."
msgstr "你有任意类型的三次杠。"

msgid "You have three of the same sequence in different suits."
msgstr "你在不同花色中有三次相同的顺子。"

msgid "You have three of the same sequence in the same suit. Note that this cannot stack with Pure Shifted Pungs (also 24 Fan) since that would arrange your sets differently."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有三次相同的顺子。请注意，这不能与一色三同顺（也是24番）复合，因为那会以不同的方式排列你的面子。"

msgid "You have three triplets of the same number."
msgstr "你有三组相同数字的刻子。"

msgid "You have three wind triplets."
msgstr "你有三种风牌的刻子。"

msgid "You have three wind triplets/kongs and a wind pair."
msgstr "你有三种风牌的刻子/杠和一对风牌。"

msgid "You have two concealed kongs. Concealed kongs are formed by drawing and declaring all four copies of a tile facedown."
msgstr "你有两组暗杠。暗杠是通过摸到并将一张牌的全部四张面朝下宣告而形成的。"

msgid "You have two dragon triplets."
msgstr "你有两组三元牌刻子。"

msgid "You have two dragon triplets/kongs and a dragon pair."
msgstr "你有两组三元牌刻子/杠和一对三元牌。"

msgid "You have two identical chows in the same suit."
msgstr "你在同一花色中有两组相同的顺子。"

msgid "You have two kongs, one melded and one concealed. A melded kong is one formed by calling the fourth tile with three copies in hand, or by adding a drawn fourth tile to an existing called triplet. A concealed kong is formed by having four copies in hand, and declaring them facedown on your turn."
msgstr "你有两次杠，一次明杠和一次暗杠。明杠是通过手中的三张取走第四张，或将摸到的第四张加到已有的叫来的刻子上形成的。暗杠是通过手中有四张，并在你的回合将它们面朝下宣告形成的。"

msgid "You have two melded kongs. A melded kong is one formed by calling the fourth tile with three copies in hand, or by adding a drawn fourth tile to an existing called triplet."
msgstr "你有两次明杠。明杠是通过手中的三张取走第四张，或将摸到的第四张加到已有的叫来的刻子上形成的。"

msgid "You have two of the same sequence in different suits. Same-suit would instead award Pure Double Chow (1 Fan)."
msgstr "你在不同花色中有两组相同的顺子。同花色则改为授予一色二顺（1番）。"

msgid "You have two triplets in hand (not called). Either one may be a Concealed Kong. Having two Concealed Kongs instead awards the 8-fan yaku Two Concealed Kongs. Having three or four Concealed Pungs instead awards the 16-fan yaku Three Concealed Pungs or the 64-fan yaku Four Concealed Pungs respectively."
msgstr "你手中有两组刻子（非叫来的）。两者都可以是暗杠。拥有两组暗杠则改为授予8番的役二暗杠。拥有三次或四次暗刻则分别改为授予16番的役三暗刻或64番的役四暗刻。"

msgid "You have two triplets of the same number (in different suits)."
msgstr "你有两组相同数字的刻子（在不同花色中）。"

msgid "You lack any tiles from one of the three suits. (Honors and flowers are suitless, so your hand can still contain these.) Stacks with No Honors (1 Fan)."
msgstr "你缺少三种花色之一的任何牌。（字牌和花牌是无花色的，所以你的手牌仍然可以包含它们。）与无字牌（1番）复合。"

msgid "You may also call ron on concealed kans, but only if you are tenpai for kokushi musou."
msgstr "你也可以在暗杠上荣和，但仅限于你为国士无双听牌时。"

msgid "You may apply any custom modifications to the ruleset by typing them in the Config tab of Game Settings. See the documentation link in the Custom gamemode for more details."
msgstr "你可以通过在游戏设置的配置选项卡中输入它们来对规则集应用任何自定义修改。有关详细信息，请参阅自定义游戏模式中的文档链接。"

msgid "You may bet 1000 points to discard facedown. Others can bet 2000 points to force it faceup, but you can bet a further 4000 points to keep it facedown."
msgstr "你可以下注1000点以暗置打出。其他人可以下注2000点迫使它面朝上，但你可以进一步下注4000点使其保持面朝下。"

msgid "You may call Pung/Kong/Quint if a just-discarded tile (not a joker!) matches 2/3/4 of the same tile in hand. You may use any amount of joker tiles for this. Pairs cannot be called. After calling, the involved tiles are shown to all players and cannot be modified. Note that there are no 'replacement tiles' in American mahjong, so in every case you will have to immediately discard from hand after calling. There is no way to 'add' to an existing called meld."
msgstr "如果刚被丢弃的牌（不是鬼牌！）与手牌中2/3/4张相同的牌匹配，你可以叫碰/杠/五张。你可以为此使用任意数量的鬼牌。不能叫对子。叫牌后，涉及的牌向所有玩家显示且无法修改。请注意，美国麻将中没有「替换牌」，所以在任何情况下你都需要在叫牌后立即从手牌中打出。「添加」到已有叫来的面子是不可能的。"

msgid "You may declare Gong to set aside four tiles in three situations:"
msgstr "你可以宣告杠来放置四张牌，情况有三种："

msgid "You may declare NEWS (one of each wind) as a concealed kan that grants immediate shuugi payments. There is also a special gold north tile that doubles said payments if you use it."
msgstr "你可以将 NEWS（每种风牌各一张）宣告为授予即时祝仪支付的暗杠。还有一张特殊的金北牌，如果你使用它，可以使所述支付翻倍。"

msgid "You may declare NEWS (one of each wind) as a concealed kan worth 16 fu."
msgstr "你可以将 NEWS（每种风牌各一张）宣告为价值16符的暗杠。"

msgid "You may discard flower tiles like normal tiles."
msgstr "你可以像普通牌一样打出花牌。"

msgid "You may kan a sequence of four number tiles."
msgstr "你可以杠一组四张数牌的顺子。"

msgid "You may kan a sequence of four number tiles. The replacement tile is drawn from the live wall. This flips kandora and can be robbed like a normal kan, but is worth half fu (4 fu open, 8 fu closed). When calculating yaku, either side of the nobekan can be used as a sequence. For example, 6789 can be used for both tanyao and chanta."
msgstr "你可以杠一组四张数牌的顺子（延杠）。替换牌是从活牌墙抽的。这会翻开杠宝牌，可以像普通杠一样被抢，但价值一半符（副露4符，门前8符）。计算役时，延杠的任何一边都可以用作顺子。例如，6789可以同时用于断么九和混全带么九。"

msgid "You may not win if any tiles of the voided suit are in your hand."
msgstr "如果你的手牌中有缺门花色的任何牌，你不能和牌。"

msgid "You may win if:"
msgstr "你可以和牌如果："

msgid "You may win with one of the following:"
msgstr "你可以通过以下任一方式和牌："

msgid "You might also note the distinct lack of character tiles in your hand. This is because most of the character suit has been removed, except for the 1 and 9 of characters."
msgstr "你可能还会注意到你手中的万子明显缺乏。这是因为除了1万和9万之外，大部分万子花色已被移除。"

msgid "You must pay a 16 point penalty to everyone if you have any tiles of the voided suit in hand, and at least one tile of a different suit in your discards."
msgstr "如果你的手牌中有缺门花色的牌，并且你的弃牌中至少有一张不同花色的牌，你必须向每个人支付16点罚。"

msgid "You win by collecting 14 unique tiles from the following 16-tile set: 147 of one suit, 258 of a second suit, 369 of a third suit, all winds, and all dragons."
msgstr "你通过从以下16张牌集合中收集14张不重复的牌来和牌：一种花色的147、第二种花色的258、第三种花色的369、所有风牌和所有三元牌。"

msgid "You win with hand containing a knitted straight: 147 of one suit, 258 of a second suit, 369 of a third suit."
msgstr "你以包含组合龙的手牌和牌：一种花色的147、第二种花色的258、第三种花色的369。"

msgid "You won by drawing the last tile in the wall."
msgstr "你以自摸牌墙最后一张牌和牌。"

msgid "You won by self-draw."
msgstr "你以自摸和牌。"

msgid "You won having collected at least 10 of the 16 flowers. 1 mủn on top of regular flower scoring."
msgstr "你收集了16张花牌中的至少10张并和牌。在常规花牌计分之上获得1 mủn。"

msgid "You won having collected at least 8 of the 16 flowers. 1 mủn on top of regular flower scoring."
msgstr "你收集了16张花牌中的至少8张并和牌。在常规花牌计分之上获得1 mủn。"

msgid "You won off a double-sided sequence wait, with a closed all-sequence hand whose pair is not yakuhai."
msgstr "你以门前清的全顺子手牌从双面顺子听牌和牌，且对子不是役牌。"

msgid "You won off a double-sided sequence wait, with an all-sequence hand whose pair is not yakuhai."
msgstr "你以全顺子手牌从双面顺子听牌和牌，且对子不是役牌。"

msgid "You won off the replacement draw after two or more consecutive Gongs."
msgstr "你在两次或更多连续杠后的替换牌上和牌。"

msgid "You won with a hand containing 4 triplets and a pair."
msgstr "你以包含4组刻子和一对的手牌和牌。"

msgid "You won with a seven-pair hand. Repeated pairs are allowed, and would award Tile Hog (2 Fan) per instance."
msgstr "你以七对子手牌和牌。允许重复对子，并且每个实例会获得牌霸（2番）。"

msgid "You won with eight flowers."
msgstr "你以八张花牌和牌。"

msgid "You won with seven flowers."
msgstr "你以七张花牌和牌。"

msgid "You won with your first draw as non-dealer."
msgstr "你作为闲家以第一次摸牌和牌。"

msgid "You won with your initial hand as dealer."
msgstr "你作为庄家以起手牌和牌。"

msgid "You're the first to play, so let's start by discarding this tile."
msgstr "你是第一个玩的，所以让我们从打出这张牌开始。"

msgid "You've also seen the 2x challenge button, which uses both challenge tokens at once, resulting in a 4x multiplier."
msgstr "你也看到了 2x 挑战按钮，它一次使用两个挑战令牌，产生 4 倍乘数。"

msgid "Your closed hand has a double sequence: two copies of the exact same sequence in one suit, like 123 123."
msgstr "你的门前清手牌有一组同顺：同一花色中两组完全相同的顺子，如123 123。"

msgid "Your final score is multiplied by the number of times the dealership is kept without a nondealer winning. (min 1)"
msgstr "你的最终分数乘以庄家没有被闲家和牌而保持庄家的次数。（最小1）"

msgid "Your hand consists of 1, 9, and honor tiles only. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌仅由1、9和字牌组成。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand consists of four triplets and a pair, and all tiles are even numbers (2468). Note that having all-even-tiles Seven Pairs (24 Fan), does not count, because this Fan only specifies triplets."
msgstr "你的手牌由四组刻子和一对组成，且所有牌都是偶数（2468）。请注意，拥有全偶数七对子（24番）不计入，因为此番只指定刻子。"

msgid "Your hand consists of one suit only with no honors (ignores flowers). Having honors instead awards Half Flush (6 Fan)."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由一种花色组成，没有字牌（忽略花牌）。有字牌则改为授予混一色（6番）。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only 1 and 9 tiles (ignoring flowers)."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由1和9的牌组成（忽略花牌）。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only all-green tiles (23468 bamboo and green dragon)."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由全绿的牌组成（23468索和发）。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only honor tiles."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由字牌组成。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only honour tiles."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由字牌组成。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only number tiles 2 through 8. In other words, you have no terminal or honor tiles."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由2至8的数牌组成。换句话说，你没有么九牌或字牌。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only one suit, i.e. two voided suits. Honors are allowed."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由一种花色组成，即有两个缺门。允许字牌。"

msgid "Your hand consists of only terminals."
msgstr "你的手牌仅由么九牌组成。"

msgid "Your hand consists of seven non-repeating pairs."
msgstr "你的手牌由七组不重复的对子组成。"

msgid "Your hand consists of seven pairs (repeats allowed)."
msgstr "你的手牌由七对组成（允许重复）。"

msgid "Your hand consists of seven pairs. Repeats allowed."
msgstr "你的手牌由七对组成。允许重复。"

msgid "Your hand consists only of the numbers 123. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌仅由数字123组成。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand consists only of the numbers 1234. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌仅由数字1234组成。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand consists only of the numbers 456. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌仅由数字456组成。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand consists only of the numbers 6789. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌仅由数字6789组成。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand consists only of the numbers 789. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌仅由数字789组成。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand contains all four of a tile (excluding kongs). Tiles in your calls count as well. Repeatable, awarding 2 Fan for each instance."
msgstr "你的手牌包含一张牌的全部四张（不包括杠）。你副露中的牌也计入。可重复，每个实例授予2番。"

msgid "Your hand contains all three gold tiles."
msgstr "你的手牌包含全部三张金牌。"

msgid "Your hand contains four kans."
msgstr "你的手牌包含四次杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains four nobekans."
msgstr "你的手牌包含四次延杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains only tiles numbered 2-8."
msgstr "你的手牌仅包含数字为2-8的牌。"

msgid "Your hand contains three gold tiles as a triplet."
msgstr "你的手牌包含三张金牌作为刻子。"

msgid "Your hand contains three kans."
msgstr "你的手牌包含三次杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains three nobekans."
msgstr "你的手牌包含三次延杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains triplets or Gongs of all three dragons."
msgstr "你的手牌包含全部三种三元牌的刻子或杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains triplets or gongs of three winds, plus a pair of the fourth wind."
msgstr "你的手牌包含三种风牌的刻子或杠，加上第四种风牌的对子。"

msgid "Your hand contains triplets or kans of all four winds."
msgstr "你的手牌包含全部四种风牌的刻子或杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains triplets or kans of all three dragons."
msgstr "你的手牌包含全部三种三元牌的刻子或杠。"

msgid "Your hand contains triplets or kans of three winds, plus a pair of the fourth wind."
msgstr "你的手牌包含三种风牌的刻子或杠，加上第四种风牌的对子。"

msgid "Your hand has each of the five kinds of tiles: characters, circles, bamboo, winds, and dragons. (Ignores flowers.)"
msgstr "你的手牌有五种牌各至少一张：万、筒、索、风和三元。（忽略花牌。）"

msgid "Your hand has exactly one flower."
msgstr "你的手牌恰好有一张花牌。"

msgid "Your hand has four closed triplets in hand, and you won by self-draw."
msgstr "你的手牌有四组暗刻，并且你以自摸和牌。"

msgid "Your hand has three closed triplets in hand, and you won by self-drawing the fourth."
msgstr "你的手牌有三组暗刻，并通过自摸第四组和牌。"

msgid "Your hand is all honor tiles (ignoring flowers)."
msgstr "你的手牌全是字牌（忽略花牌）。"

msgid "Your hand is composed of tiles from the following (ignore flowers):"
msgstr "你的手牌由以下牌组成（忽略花牌）："

msgid "Your hand is concealed and is all one suit in the nine gates shape (1112345678999 + one extra tile)."
msgstr "你的手牌为门前清，且全部是同一花色的九莲宝灯形状（1112345678999 + 一张额外的牌）。"

msgid "Your hand must be closed."
msgstr "你的手牌必须是门前清。"

msgid "Your hand must score at least %{score} %{han} to win."
msgstr "你的手牌必须至少得分%{score} %{han}才能和牌。"

msgid "Your hand must score at least mangan to win."
msgstr "你的手牌必须至少得分满贯才能和牌。"

msgid "Your initial draw includes a wildcard (Hun'er)! The wildcards for this round are the 2 and 3 of circles, indicated on the upper left."
msgstr "你的起手摸牌包含一张万能牌（混儿）！本局的万能牌是2筒和3筒，显示在左上角。"

msgid "Your pair is made of two gold tiles."
msgstr "你的对子由两张金牌组成。"

msgid "Your pair must not be a value pair (pair of dragons, round wind, or seat wind)."
msgstr "你的对子不能是有值的对子（三元牌、圈风或自风的对子）。"

msgid "Your standard hand (4 sets and a pair) includes five different kinds of groups. That is, you have five out of: pair, sequence, triplet, kontsu, kan, fuun."
msgstr "你的标准手牌（4组面子和一对）包含五种不同的组。也就是说，你拥有了对子、顺子、刻子、混合刻子、杠、风圈中的五种。"

msgid "Your winning hand consists of one of each terminal/honor tile plus one forming a pair."
msgstr "你的和牌由每种么九牌/字牌各一张，加上一张形成对子。"

msgid "Yumeno Maho"
msgstr "梦乃真帆"

msgid "Zan Sanma"
msgstr "残三麻"

msgid "Zan Scoring"
msgstr "残计分"

msgid "Zan Shuugi"
msgstr "残祝仪"

msgid "Zimo"
msgstr "自摸"

msgid "Zombie Blanks"
msgstr "僵尸白版"

msgid "Zung Jung"
msgstr "中庸"

msgid "\\\"Five Suits Collected\\\". Your standard hand (4 sets and a pair) includes all five suits (character, circle, bamboo, wind, dragon)."
msgstr "「五色集和」。你的标准手牌（4组面子和一对）包含全部五种花色（万、筒、索、风、三元）。"

msgid "\\\"Five Suits Collected\\\". Your standard hand (4 sets and a pair) includes all five suits (character, circle, bamboo, wind, dragon). Mixed triplets (kontsu) of winds and dragons can be used, but not mixed triplets of suited tiles."
msgstr "「五色集和」。你的标准手牌（4组面子和一对）包含全部五种花色（万、筒、索、风、三元）。可以使用风牌和三元牌的混合刻子，但不能使用数牌的混合刻子。"

msgid "\\\"Five-Heart Straight\\\". 1 han on top of ittsuu if the winning tile is the five needed for ittsuu."
msgstr "「五心通贯」。如果和牌是完成一气通贯所需的五，则在一气通贯之上额外+1番。"

msgid "\\\"Four Consecutive Triplets\\\". You have four triplets of the same suit of increasing number, like 111 222 333 444."
msgstr "「四连刻」。你拥有同一花色数字递增的四组刻子，如111 222 333 444。"

msgid "\\\"Missing Tile\\\". Win with an edge or middle wait on a tile for which three copies are already publicly visible."
msgstr "「欠牌」。以边张或嵌张听牌和牌，且该牌已有三张公开可见。"

msgid "\\\"Pure Quadruple Sequences\\\". You have four of the exact same sequence in one suit, like 123m 123m 123m 123m. Like iipeikou but four."
msgstr "「一色四顺」。你在单一花色中拥有四次完全相同的顺子，如123m 123m 123m 123m。就像一杯口，但是四次。"

msgid "\\\"Pure Triple Sequences\\\". 2 han if you have three of the exact same sequence in one suit, like 123 123 123. Like iipeikou but three. 3 han if closed. Does not stack with iipeikou (123 123) or sanrenkou (111 222 333)."
msgstr "「一色三顺」。如果你在单一花色中拥有三次完全相同的顺子，如123 123 123，可获得2番。就像一杯口，但是三次。门前清则为3番。不与一杯口（123 123）或三连刻（111 222 333）复合。"

msgid "\\\"Thirteen Independent\\\". Yakuman if you start with 14 disconnected tiles. Calls invalidate."
msgstr "「十三无靠」。如果你以14张不相连的牌开始，则为役满。副露无效。"

msgid "\\\"Thirteen Unconnected\\\". Yakuman if you start with 13 disconnected tiles, plus one forming a pair. Calls invalidate."
msgstr "「十三不搭」。如果你以13张不相连的牌开始，加上一张形成对子，则为役满。副露无效。"

